  "content": "<h1>麥當勞結構 🍔</h1><p><strong>此模組</strong>&nbsp;將&nbsp;<strong>麥當勞結構加入《Minecraft》</strong>，於&nbsp;<strong>平原生態域</strong>&nbsp;中生成，為&nbsp;<strong>原版遊戲</strong>&nbsp;增添速食氛圍，並加入具功能的&nbsp;<strong>麥當勞餐廳</strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00ec2a07259033c2c13b1fdf58cb1274d94b3f0e.png\" alt=\"牛肉物品\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86de3dddf4929dd95e89b99d75b6539b6ec75a3c.jpeg\" alt=\"麥當勞結構宣傳圖\"></p><blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp © - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote><h2>注意事項📝</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>麥當勞結構</strong>&nbsp;相容於&nbsp;<strong>1.20 至 1.21.10</strong>&nbsp;版本🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>麥當勞結構</strong>&nbsp;為世界生成加入新&nbsp;<strong>（結構）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>麥當勞結構</strong>&nbsp;可與任何&nbsp;<strong>世界生成類模組</strong>&nbsp;相容</li>\n<li><strong>無需</strong>&nbsp;解壓縮下載的檔案🗂️</li>\n<li>建議&nbsp;<strong>使用耳機</strong>&nbsp;以獲得&nbsp;<strong>更佳體驗</strong>&nbsp;🎧</li>\n</ul><h1>描述 🎼</h1><p>在更沉浸的體驗中享受原版《Minecraft》，&nbsp;<strong>為平原生態域加入全新的速食結構&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"></strong>，為&nbsp;<strong>村民結構</strong>&nbsp;增添更多世界觀🌎</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/735192e11a55b49e537ecd78941be0d95a6d928c.jpeg\" alt=\"麥當勞結構內部宣傳圖\"> 透過此&nbsp;<strong>模組</strong>，探索🧭變得更加刺激，為&nbsp;<strong>平原帶來獨特的速食體驗</strong>。</p><h2>生成方式🌐</h2><p><strong>麥當勞結構</strong>&nbsp;如其名稱所示，生成於&nbsp;<strong>平原生態域</strong>，若想透過&nbsp;<strong>指令定位，請使用：</strong>&nbsp;<code>/locate structure luistercorp:mc_donalds</code></p><h2>新增成就 🏆</h2><p><strong>若你發現此結構</strong>，將獲得名為&nbsp;<strong>「大麥克成就」</strong>&nbsp;的&nbsp;<strong>新成就</strong>，顯示如下：</p><p>◾&nbsp;<strong>圖片&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00ec2a07259033c2c13b1fdf58cb1274d94b3f0e.png\" alt=\"牛肉物品\">：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/550aa601d23d902ae3f378a49f50ad6710dbdd6d.png\" alt=\"麥當勞成就圖示\"></p>",
